+	/* inv 29-l5-gring: with IAU_INV_GLOBAL_RING=1|2 nvmf_tgt treats the record ring of every Mode D
+	 * SQ as a shared ring of IAU_INV_GLOBAL_RING_ENTRIES records, so every Mode D IO qpair with a
+	 * record ring must complete through its poll group's shared ring: an ineligible one fails
+	 * construct here (no stock fallback). Eligible = 20's trfree path with the LOCKED 32 B record
